  "description": "This project is an example of developing a C# library that can use features from [SDL3](https://www.libsdl.org/index.php) native libraries and that integrates with the [SIPSorcery](https://github.com/sipsorcery-org/sipsorcery) real-time communications library.\n\n\t\tThe classes in this project provide Audio End Point and Audio Source features.\n\n\t\tAudio Codecs supported by this library: PCMU (G711), PCMA (G711), G722, G729 and Opus",
